{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5a942056-49fd-8e2d-8297-a2595b91d14e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T10:34:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities Division, this is Tony. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Yes, I'm calling about my water and sewer bill. First, it's way higher than it should be. Second, they put in a new meter last month. And third, I want to know why those two things go together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's take a look. Who's the account under, and what's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, so, first, the account is still in my husband's name. He passed, and I never changed it over. Second, I'm a renter, so the landlord handles the, the [line breaks up] the paperwork mostly, but the bill comes to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:29:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. The bill comes to you, but the account is in your husband's name. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's right. His name. Can you hear me okay now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, much better. What's the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lombardozzi. Same as mine. Josephine is me. His was Dennis, but I don't want to go through the whole thing again, I just want the bill looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Give me a second, I'll pull up Lombardozzi. [pause] Okay, I've got it. So I see the new meter reading came in on the last cycle. What looks off to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First, it's forty-eight fifty. It's never been that. Second, my usage hasn't changed, it's me and nobody else, and I'm not running a laundromat. Third, nobody told me the meter change would do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Here's what's probably going on. When they swap a meter, the first bill can have a partial period on the old meter and a partial on the new one. So you might see the old final reading and the new starting reading, and sometimes the new meter just reads more accurately than the old one, which was likely running slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's my fault the old one was slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not at all. Old meters tend to under-read as they age, so the usage you were billed before could've been low. That doesn't make you at fault, it's just catching up to what you actually use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm. Okay. I don't love it. Can you at least check that the readings are right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can flag it for a re-read and have somebody confirm the number on the new meter. That's usually a few days to a week or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And I want it in writing. First, what you just told me about the old meter and the new meter. Second, the re-read request. Can you send that to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put a note on the account and have the explanation mailed out. Do you want it going to the address on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:32:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the address on the bill. Not to his name, though, put it to Josephine if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it to your attention. And while we're at it, you can get your name added to the account down the road. Whenever you're ready, we'd walk you through what we'd need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, later. Not today. I'm already annoyed enough with this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:32:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally fair. Do you want to hold off on paying until the re-read comes back, or take care of it now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just pay it. I don't want a late notice on top of everything. I'll do the card, right now, while I'm on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, go ahead whenever you're ready with the card number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's three seven eight two, eight two two four six three, one zero zero zero five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Three seven eight two, eight two two four six three, one zero zero zero five. And the expiration date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh four, twenty-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero four, twenty-nine. And for the amount, that's forty-eight fifty, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, forty-eight dollars and fifty cents. That's what it says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's going through. [pause] All set, that went through fine. You'll get a confirmation, and I've put in the re-read request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:33:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. Sorry if I sounded short. I'm doing a vegetarian week, and honestly I miss bacon, so I'm not at my best."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I get it. Bacon's tough to give up. Hang in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:34:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. So just to repeat, first, re-read. Second, letter in writing. Third, payment done. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:34:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly it. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Tony. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Josephine. Take care, and enjoy the rest of your holiday week."
    }
  ],
